1
00:00:01,951 --> 00:00:04,154
    <font color="#aaaaaa">- Will you ask if Francis</font>
 <font color="#aaaaaa">will not agree to t marriage</font>

2
00:00:04,237 --> 00:00:06,656
    <font color="#aaaaaa">of Elizabeth to his son?</font>
   <font color="#aaaaaa">- It might be better for us</font>
      <font color="#aaaaaa">to pursue an alliance</font>

3
00:00:06,740 --> 00:00:08,875
        <font color="#aaaaaa">with the Emperor.</font>
  <font color="#aaaaaa">- That would suit Katherine.</font>

4
00:00:08,908 --> 00:00:11,127
   <font color="#aaaaaa">- Leave the greater things</font>
           <font color="#aaaaaa">to my care.</font>

5
00:00:11,211 --> 00:00:13,997
 <font color="#aaaaaa">- Anyone can see that the King</font>
 <font color="#aaaaaa">is not so much in love with her</font>
 <font color="#aaaaaa">as he used to be. What's wrong?</font>

6
00:00:14,080 --> 00:00:16,049
         <font color="#aaaaaa">- I don't know.</font>
      <font color="#aaaaaa">Perhaps she's afraid.</font>

7
00:00:16,082 --> 00:00:18,668
   <font color="#aaaaaa">- So long as they are both</font>
     <font color="#aaaaaa">alive, I can't be safe.</font>

8
00:00:18,752 --> 00:00:23,089
 <font color="#aaaaaa">I can just order their deaths!</font>
        <font color="#aaaaaa">[Maniacal laugh]</font>
    <font color="#aaaaaa">- You're crazy! Stop it!</font>

9
00:00:23,139 --> 00:00:25,475
  <font color="#aaaaaa">You're the Queen of England.</font>
          <font color="#aaaaaa">Act like it!</font>

10
00:00:25,558 --> 00:00:28,928
   <font color="#aaaaaa">- From now on, we must all</font>
     <font color="#aaaaaa">be careful not to lose</font>
        <font color="#aaaaaa">the King's love,</font>

11
00:00:29,012 --> 00:00:30,930
     <font color="#aaaaaa">or everything is lost.</font>

12
00:00:30,980 --> 00:00:33,183
      <font color="#aaaaaa">- Sir John, you have</font>
      <font color="#aaaaaa">an unexpected guest.</font>

13
00:00:33,266 --> 00:00:36,269
  <font color="#aaaaaa">- Your Majesty, may I present</font>
 <font color="#aaaaaa">my daughter, Lady Jane Seymour?</font>

14
00:00:36,319 --> 00:00:39,522
     <font color="#aaaaaa">- The hours of my death</font>
         <font color="#aaaaaa">draws fast on,</font>

15
00:00:39,606 --> 00:00:41,941
     <font color="#aaaaaa">and I commend unto you</font>
       <font color="#aaaaaa">our daughter Mary.</font>

16
00:00:41,991 --> 00:00:44,444
      <font color="#aaaaaa">beseeching you to be</font>
         <font color="#aaaaaa">a good father.</font>

17
00:00:44,494 --> 00:00:46,780
     <font color="#aaaaaa">- Now I'm indeed Queen.</font>

18
00:00:46,863 --> 00:00:51,367
 <font color="#aaaaaa">- The King of England has been</font>
   <font color="#aaaaaa">carried far from the shore,</font>
    <font color="#aaaaaa">but he does not know it.</font>

19
00:00:51,451 --> 00:00:53,336
  <font color="#aaaaaa">He thinks he can swim alone.</font>

20
00:00:53,420 --> 00:00:55,755
   <font color="#aaaaaa">Very soon, he will realize</font>

21
00:00:55,789 --> 00:00:58,792
       <font color="#aaaaaa">he is not swimming,</font>
          <font color="#aaaaaa">but drowning.</font>

22
00:00:58,875 --> 00:01:01,127
  <font color="#aaaaaa">- Have you told her about me?</font>
              <font color="#aaaaaa">- No.</font>
      <font color="#aaaaaa">- Why the hell not?!</font>

23
00:01:01,177 --> 00:01:05,799
 <font color="#aaaaaa">- If you could read Greek, you</font>
  <font color="#aaaaaa">would know that even the gods</font>
 <font color="#aaaaaa">had problems with their wives.</font>

24
00:01:05,882 --> 00:01:08,101
  <font color="#aaaaaa">- You are determined to close</font>
      <font color="#aaaaaa">every religious house</font>
           <font color="#aaaaaa">in England.</font>

25
00:01:08,134 --> 00:01:10,603
  <font color="#aaaaaa">You are far too high-handed,</font>
          <font color="#aaaaaa">Mr. Cromwell.</font>

26
00:01:10,637 --> 00:01:13,306
    <font color="#aaaaaa">You ought to be careful,</font>
   <font color="#aaaaaa">or I will have you cropped</font>
          <font color="#aaaaaa">at the neck.</font>

27
00:01:13,389 --> 00:01:16,609
    <font color="#aaaaaa">- I did not bring you up</font>
      <font color="#aaaaaa">to quarrel with those</font>
      <font color="#aaaaaa">closest to the Crown.</font>

28
00:01:16,643 --> 00:01:19,846
     <font color="#aaaaaa">- I am the King's wife.</font>
    <font color="#aaaaaa">- And you should remember</font>
       <font color="#aaaaaa">how you got there!</font>

29
00:01:21,064 --> 00:01:24,367
      <font color="#aaaaaa">- He fell in love with me.</font>
                <font color="#aaaaaa">He respected me.</font>

30
00:01:24,451 --> 00:01:28,371
<font color="#aaaaaa">- Your daughter Jane should come</font>
<font color="#aaaaaa">to court as Lady to Her Majesty.</font>
   <font color="#aaaaaa">- Thank you, Your Majesty.</font>

31
00:01:28,455 --> 00:01:32,542
 <font color="#aaaaaa">- I am carrying the King's son.</font>

32
00:01:32,625 --> 00:01:36,663
      <font color="#aaaaaa">- We are on the edge</font>
       <font color="#aaaaaa">of a golden world!</font>

